OL,3,GNEWSASchool land #1 deal to cost #15m  
OL,4,Aover a decade                          
OL,6,FA government could acquire land for    
OL,7,Fjust #1 as it moves forward with plans 
OL,8,Ffor a new town primary school.         
OL,10,FIn a report presented to the Jersey    
OL,11,FStates Assembly, Infrastructure        
OL,12,FMinister Jonathan Renouf approved the  
OL,13,Facquisition of two parcels of land at  
OL,14,FGas Place in St Helier from Andium     
OL,15,FHomes for the school.                  
