OL,3,GNEWSASchool land #1 deal to cost #15m  
OL,4,Aover a decade                          
OL,6,FThe 2.25 acre (0.9 hectare) site was   
OL,7,Fbought by States-owned housing provider
OL,8,FAndium Homes in 2017 for #10m with     
OL,9,Fplans, later withdrawn, for a major    
OL,10,Fredevelopment including 297 flats,     
OL,11,Fcommercial units, parking and public   
OL,12,Fspaces.                                
OL,14,FWhile the States will acquire the site 
OL,15,Ffor #1, taxpayers will compensate      
OL,16,FAndium Homes with #15m over 10 years   
OL,17,Fthrough reduced payments from Andium,  
OL,18,Fthe report says.                       
